event: final
data: {"type":"final","sequence":0,"request_id":"28f9b1af-79d2-4d2d-b03a-10bfcd73af98","status":true,"message":"Chat turn processed successfully.","timestamp":"2026-08-14T09:18:09.502710+00:00","data":{"ai_message":"### Survey ready\n\nYour survey draft, **“Why Are Learners Leaving LearnSphere?”**, is ready with **25 respondent-facing questions**. It follows the approved linear structure and is designed to distinguish the experiences of current, inactive, potential, parent, teacher, and administrator audiences where relevant.\n\n### Research strategy\n\nThis is a **mixed-methodology, multi-objective study** combining usage and attitude research, learner experience measurement, churn/exit diagnosis, competitive evaluation, and feature prioritization. The findings will help LearnSphere determine which learner-experience, content, motivation, feedback, technology, and journey issues to address first to increase sustained engagement, course completion, return usage, and recommendations—and identify which inactive learners may be recoverable.\n\n### Survey structure\n\nRespondents move through six ordered sections: **Hook, Warm-Up & Screening; Usage & Behavior; Attitude & Motivation; CX/Satisfaction; Competitive; and Future Intent/Close**. The flow starts with recent behavior and last-active-stage reconstruction, then explores friction and motivations before measuring satisfaction, competitive perceptions, win-back opportunities, and priorities for improvement. It closes with future intent and an open-ended improvement question.\n\n### Routing & logic\n\nSmart branching and screening logic has been built in, with **6 routing rules** covering branching, skip logic, and screening gates. **2 dynamic carry-forward filters** also tailor follow-up questions based on respondents’ earlier answers.\n\n### Invitation to review\n\nPlease review the draft and let me know if you’d like to adjust the audience definitions, wording, response options, routing, or emphasis on any research goal before fielding.","chat_id":"e024bd98-0387-4ac2-87a9-434265ef3921","guest_id":null,"chat_turn_id":"b0885bb1-06c8-4f3b-bab8-26663cd2ffe5","chat_name":"Why Are Learners Leaving LearnSphere?","turn_number":9,"survey_turn_number":1,"questions":[{"id":"preview_question_1","qId":"d0a494b2-eb08-45ea-bc47-ec6c877ff3bf","text":"Which of these best describes your connection with learning decisions or digital learning?","type":"multiple_choice","audio_url":null,"image_url":null,"video_url":null,"watch_only":null,"file_type":null,"validation_description":null,"subheading":"Select all that apply","placeholder":null,"minChar":null,"maxChar":null,"allow_multiple_answers":true,"start_range":null,"end_range":null,"low_rating_label":null,"high_rating_label":null,"options":[{"text":"I currently use LearnSphere","index":0,"image_url":null,"video_url":null,"type":null,"is_explainable":null,"placeholder":null,"minChar":null,"maxChar":null,"min_selection":1,"max_selection":7,"deselect_all":null},{"text":"I previously used LearnSphere","index":1,"image_url":null,"video_url":null,"type":null,"is_explainable":null,"placeholder":null,"minChar":null,"maxChar":null,"min_selection":null,"max_selection":null,"deselect_all":null},{"text":"I may use a digital-learning platform","index":2,"image_url":null,"video_url":null,"type":null,"is_explainable":null,"placeholder":null,"minChar":null,"maxChar":null,"min_selection":null,"max_selection":null,"deselect_all":null},{"text":"I am a parent or guardian involved in learning decisions","index":3,"image_url":null,"video_url":null,"type":null,"is_explainable":null,"placeholder":null,"minChar":null,"maxChar":null,"min_selection":null,"max_selection":null,"deselect_all":null},{"text":"I am a teacher or instructor","index":4,"image_url":null,"video_url":null,"type":null,"is_explainable":null,"placeholder":null,"minChar":null,"maxChar":null,"min_selection":null,"max_selection":null,"deselect_all":null},{"text":"I am an academic administrator","index":5,"image_url":null,"video_url":null,"type":null,"is_explainable":null,"placeholder":null,"minChar":null,"maxChar":null,"min_selection":null,"max_selection":null,"deselect_all":null},{"text":"Other","index":6,"image_url":null,"video_url":null,"type":null,"is_explainable":true,"placeholder":null,"minChar":null,"maxChar":null,"min_selection":null,"max_selection":null,"deselect_all":null}],"dropdown_options":null,"fields":null,"super_j_question_id":null,"ranking_groups":null,"next":null,"complete":null,"terminate":null,"expectedAnswer":[],"validationQuestion":false,"filterFrom":null,"filterOut":null,"filterFromConfig":null,"filterOutConfig":null,"showIf":null,"showIfElse":null,"showIfLogic":null,"shuffle":true,"break_heading":null,"break_message":null,"breakVariant":null,"progress_percent":null,"keyboardType":null,"flow_key":"STAKEHOLDER_ROLE","business_role":"screener","route_group":"hook_warm_up_and_screening","analysis_tags":["stakeholder_role","learnsphere_relationship","learning_frequency","learning_stop_point","social_learning_value","alternative_platform_usage","alternative_share_of_learning_time","parent_success_criteria","administrator_success_criteria"],"stimulus_id":null,"cell_id":null,"randomization_group":null,"display_order_group":null,"exposure_acknowledged":null},{"id":"preview_question_2","qId":"900e0c62-94fa-4840-a822-8cfafbccf087","text":"Which one best describes your current relationship with LearnSphere?","type":"multiple_choice","audio_url":null,"image_url":null,"video_url":null,"watch_only":null,"file_type":null,"validation_description":null,"subheading":null,"placeholder":null,"minChar":null,"maxChar":null,"allow_multiple_answers":false,"start_range":null,"end_range":null,"low_rating_label":null,"high_rating_label":null,"options":[{"text":"Current LearnSphere learner","index":0,"image_url":null,"video_url":null,"type":null,"is_explainable":null,"placeholder":null,"minChar":null,"maxChar":null,"min_selection":null,"max_selection":null,"deselect_all":